Package: lulcBR
Type: Package
Title: Land Use and Land Cover (LULC) Analysis for Brazil (Based on MapBiomas Collection 10)
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:   person("Jaqueline", "Lopes Polvani", email = "jaqueline.lopes-polvani@stud-mail.uni-wuerzburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre")) 
Description: Extracts and analyzes Brazil LULC data based on Mapbiomas LULC classification rasters. 
    Provides functions for LULC visualization, transition matrices, stability maps, trend analysis and animations. 
    Implements cloud‑based reading for time series processing.
